# quality-refactor plan 2026-09-30). Dropping the real `seed.options` and
# always storing `{}` loses every option (the typed name, the palette, the
# mirror) on every save, so the typed name this test checks for in
# localStorage never reaches it.
diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
